    ["El secreto es practicar un poco todos los días.","The secret is to practice a little every day."],
    ["Diez minutos al día son mejores que dos horas una vez por semana.","Ten minutes a day are better than two hours once a week."],
    ["Escuchen, repitan y no tengan miedo de cometer errores.","Listen, repeat, and don't be afraid of making mistakes."],
    ["¡Ustedes pueden hacerlo!","You can do it!"]],
